# The Boom's Big Day (levels/playground/boom.txt): walk onto the Boom, fly the spike pit (over
# the first pillar, under the stalactite, over the second, under the spiky ceiling), eating the
# beans on the way; dodge the diapers; hop off on the ledge. Then on foot under three more
# diapers (stop at each whistle), the second Boom over the sewage lake, the goal.
t=0.3 press Right
t=1.2 press Up
t=2.3 release Up
t=2.9 press Down
t=3.5 release Down
t=5.6 press Up
t=6.6 release Up
t=8.4 press Down
t=9.0 release Down
t=12.0 release Right
wait 2
